Extra roots for data/cert/x509_crt_bundle.bin, added on top of Mozilla's list
by scripts/build_cert_bundle.py.

The certificate bundle check in Arduino-ESP32 2.0.x looks up only the issuer
of the last certificate a server sends. Servers still send cross-signed chains
that end in a root Mozilla has since dropped, so that root has to be here even
though a newer root in the list would vouch for the same server.

GlobalSign Root CA (R1), SHA-256 fingerprint
ebd41040e4bb3ec742c9e381d31ef2a41a48b6685c96e7cef3c1df6cd4331c99.
opendata.adsb.fi (Google Trust Services) sends GTS Root R4 cross-signed by it.

